# h4 memory-reduction stage `tune` (synthetic-until-validated; n_seeds=8)

Margin pre-declared: +-0.01 success (strict tier +-0.005); reference = full (unbounded) memory, paired by seed. EQ = TOST p<0.05 (Holm-adjusted over the main-world family; controls use raw p). bytes = final resident estimate / full at D=64; proj384 = same retained set priced at D=384. lat = mean search time vs full (parallel runs, noisy). dSucc vs full-rd = sensitivity comparison against UNBOUNDED memory whose router down-weights old cases (recency half-life, tuned on seeds 1-8 only; added after the first held-out run, disclosed).

